art":461,"end":461,"description":"Phosphoserine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":462,"end":462,"description":"Phosphoserine"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Found in a complex with TOLLIP; interacts (via GAT domain) with TOLLIP (via N-terminus); the interactions leads to TOM1-recruitment to endosomes and inhibition of TOLLIP binding to PtdIns(3)P (PubMed:14563850, PubMed:15047686, PubMed:26320582, PubMed:31263572). Interacts (via GAT domain and the C-terminal part of the VHS domain) with UBC/ubiquitin (PubMed:14563850, PubMed:15047686, PubMed:16199040, PubMed:31263572). Interacts (via clathrin box and C-terminus) with clathrin heavy chain (PubMed:14563850, PubMed:15657082). Interacts with MYO6 (PubMed:23023224, PubMed:31371777). Interacts with TAX1BP1; CALCOCO2/NDP52 and OPTN; the interaction is indirect and is mediated by MYO6, which acts as a bridge between TOM1 and the three autophagy receptors (PubMed:31371777). Interacts (via C-terminus) with ZFYVE16 (via C-terminus); interaction is required to target TOM1 and clathrin to endosomes (PubMed:14613930, PubMed:15657082). Interacts with LRBA (PubMed:31263572)"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"O60784-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":493,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000411850.5"],"refseq":["NM_001135732.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001129204.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,441],[444,443,50]],"edits":[{"start":441,"end":442,"original":"EE","replacement":"EGK","added":3}],"missing":0,"replaced":1,"novel":2,"foldedAbsent":1,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[13,0,1]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-O60784-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-O60784-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":69.3,"plddt":[[0,1],[50,4],[70,1],[90,37],[70,1],[90,107],[70,2],[50,6],[0,2],[50,1],[0,1],[50,1],[0,42],[50,3],[70,7],[90,22],[70,2],[90,1],[70,5],[90,29],[70,1],[90,2],[70,1],[90,20],[70,1],[90,2],[70,5],[50,2],[0,25],[50,3],[0,2],[50,1],[0,26],[50,8],[0,